#* {{quote-book|year=2006 |title=Nematodes, Leeches, and Other Worms  |author= |page=38 |ISBN=0756516153 |passage=When a peanut worm feeds, it extends and waves its '''introvert''' so that the mouth at the tip wanders across the seabed. }}
